{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_041_23_5_02_041_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:45905481ddf5a98f30927fd534a2449b44206cd78f60af4e2b7316683de11b98",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_041_23_5_02_041_23:5_02_041_23:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6d272e3a2dc034c02327c6749f2d5b1e26e90166254c865f12e54bc2ffedf1d",
      "text": "我有样东西想交给\n●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_041_23_5_02_041_23:5_02_041_23:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef3e3aa2e3c59c1068f14fae4fe97421d1ec00b7ebe7581c0acf5bf6656fef58",
      "text": "……来！\n这是我送你的白色情人节回礼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_041_23_5_02_041_23:5_02_041_23:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7e8266a78304c6acc523897738228ba5aeafedf9dbc31f8042cd8b7897ef1e8",
      "text": "非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_041_23_5_02_041_23:5_02_041_23:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b099bab484eb872f962c86381a70e18c06d65cf0d3de91b4f8029f74b796ccf",
      "text": "我试吃了好多种，想着如果要送给制作人的话\n非这个莫属！于是就挑了这个呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_041_23_5_02_041_23:5_02_041_23:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef6cb6e4d752c4e6c8757c138e83b66cca8ac6437724e43043a9c38aef9992fe",
      "text": "外包装非常时髦别致呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_041_23_5_02_041_23:5_02_041_23:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4440c1db2689a170ed3a7a7515ee8884b717e21a2b78ee5dab3499d3b53ce8b3",
      "text": "制作人也这么觉得吗！？\n盒子本身也是我决定选它的关键之一哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_041_23_5_02_041_23:5_02_041_23:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9aed49e1e601e7d93595bc0a45d129a17b63f320aaecd9f215c65c3723178ed3",
      "text": "（能被注意到真开心啊。本来还在想送大一点的礼盒会不会更好，\n但选这个真是太对啦！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_041_23_5_02_041_23:5_02_041_23:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:338d92a4d8b14a61e2296c9bff2848590631fea591a90b4fac0685fdcdb64589",
      "text": "原来是这样啊！我现在可以打开看看吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_041_23_5_02_041_23:5_02_041_23:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa29cf4c548ca17ed9666690905b33b95412a1bf6cacadf1f721e37e789b2211",
      "text": "当然可以！里面装的巧克力\n也非常时尚优雅哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_041_23_5_02_041_23:5_02_041_23:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79f231d79ea3da84d25c558909ce0e0a98668a4a3a2fb312902e1f7bc5e65a00",
      "text": "我挑选了感觉很衬制作人的款式，\n如果里面的巧克力你也能喜欢我就太高兴啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
